{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Know That Flag!', you're not just guessing. We've crafted five innovative game modes to challenge every aspect of your flag knowledge:&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Challenge (Flag to Country):</strong> The classic test \u2013 see a flag, pick the country. Simple, but endlessly fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reverse Recall (Country to Flag):</strong> Can you picture the flag just from the country's name? A true memory challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language Link:</strong> Connect a country's official language to its flag. Expand your cultural insights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currency Quest:</strong> Match flags to their unique currencies. A fascinating blend of geography and economics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capital Connection:</strong> Identify the flag by knowing its capital city. Prove your geographical expertise!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788410?t=1752811238","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788410/b8ea224de2f6c56be736a14b6f754a783d71f014/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752811238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788410/5798a31b2c5a5d69e1ac3d7982d05f6ebb012464/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752811238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788410/5798a31b2c5a5d69e1ac3d7982d05f6ebb012464/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752811238","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Know That Flag!', you're not just guessing. We've crafted five innovative game modes to challenge every aspect of your flag knowledge:&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><